                      "promptContent": "\n{\n  \"context\": [ \"Your job is to list the rules this loan broke and explain each one in simple words. Give the rule name, what the rule asked for, and what the loan had. Do not say if it is big or small, and do not say how to fix it. A human auditor makes the final call.\", \"If the auditor asks which rules the loan broke, list each broken rule and explain it in plain words.\", \"If the auditor asks what evidence or documents are missing, outstanding, or still needed — a status question — use List Missing Evidence. Do not use it when the auditor asks you to draft or write something.\", \"If the auditor asks to summarize a case, use Summarize Case.\", \"If the auditor asks to draft a finding, use Draft Finding Text.\", \"If the auditor asks to draft, write, prepare, or compose a message, email, or letter requesting missing documents from the borrower or branch, use Draft Evidence Request — never List Missing Evidence for drafting requests.\" ],\n  \"context_variables\": \"\",\n  \"available_functions\": [ \"/List_Missing_Evidence_179gL0000027Q1S({\\\"auditCaseId\\\": \\\"(string) The 15- or 18-character Salesforce record Id of the Audit_Case__c the auditor is asking about.\\\"}) Lists what is still needed to clear an audit case: every tracked document that is not yet linked (required documents first, then optional), plus any replay checks that could not be verified because the supporting papers are missing. Read only — it never links evidence and never decides whether an item is cleared. A human auditor decides.\", \"/Summarize_Case_179gL0000027Q1S({\\\"auditCaseId\\\": \\\"(string) The 15- or 18-character Salesforce record Id of the Audit_Case__c the auditor is asking about.\\\"}) Assembles a plain-English briefing of an audit case from stored data: loan snapshot (amount, property value, DTI, LTV, FICO), replay results (passed / not passed / could not be checked with the named broken rules), evidence status (linked vs. missing, required documents first), case status, risk tier, and due date. Read only — it never re-runs the check and never decides compliance. A human auditor makes the final call.\", \"/Draft_Finding_Text_179gL0000027Q1S({\\\"auditCaseId\\\": \\\"(string) The 15- or 18-character Salesforce record Id of the Audit_Case__c the auditor is asking about.\\\",\\\"replayCheckId\\\": \\\"(optional string) Optional Id of the specific Replay_Check__c to draft the finding from.\\\",\\\"ruleCode\\\": \\\"(optional string) Optional rule code such as DTI_MAX naming the failed rule to draft a finding for.\\\"}) Drafts finding narrative text from a failing replay check (given an audit case plus a replay check id or a rule code): the plain rule name and code, what the rule expects versus what the loan shows, why it matters, and the linked evidence. The text is a starting point suitable for the Finding Description field. Draft only — it never creates or edits a Finding record; the human auditor accepts or edits it and makes the final determination.\", \"/Diagnose_Loan_Audit_179gL0000027Q1S({\\\"auditCaseId\\\": \\\"(string) The 15- or 18-character Salesforce record Id of the Audit_Case__c the auditor is asking about.\\\"}) Explains what is wrong with an already-approved loan, read only, from stored replay checks. Names each broken rule, the expected threshold, and the loan's actual value in plain words. A human auditor makes the final call.\", \"/Draft_Evidence_Request_179gL0000027Q1S({\\\"auditCaseId\\\": \\\"(string) The 15- or 18-character Salesforce record Id of the Audit_Case__c to draft an evidence request for.\\\"}) Drafts a professional message asking the borrower or branch for the documents still needed to complete an audit case: every required document that is not yet linked (required first, then optional), formatted as a request the auditor can send. Read only — it never sends anything, never creates or changes evidence records, and never decides the loan. The draft carries a polite deadline placeholder for the auditor to fill in, and a human auditor reviews and sends it.\" ],\n  \"function_history\": [ \"/List_Missing_Evidence({ \\\"auditCaseId\\\": \\\"a05gL00000JtZ74QAF\\\" }) = is_success=true, output = {\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"status\\\":\\\"Missing\\\",\\\"ruleName\\\":null,\\\"ruleCode\\\":null,\\\"required\\\":true,\\\"kind\\\":\\\"Evidence\\\",\\\"documentType\\\":\\\"Appraisal\\\"},{\\\"status\\\":\\\"Missing\\\",\\\"ruleName\\\":null,\\\"ruleCode\\\":null,\\\"required\\\":true,\\\"kind\\\":\\\"Evidence\\\",\\\"documentType\\\":\\\"Recorded Mortgage\\\"},{\\\"status\\\":\\\"Missing\\\",\\\"ruleName\\\":null,\\\"ruleCode\\\":null,\\\"required\\\":true,\\\"kind\\\":\\\"Evidence\\\",\\\"documentType\\\":\\\"Final Title Policy\\\"}],\\\"missingEvidenceCount\\\":3,\\\"requiredMissingCount\\\":3,\\\"summary\\\":\\\"Case AC-000624 is still missing 3 required documents: Appraisal, Recorded Mortgage, Final Title Policy. A human auditor decides whether these items are cleared.\\\",\\\"unverifiableCount\\\":0}\", \"/GetDateTime({\\\"timeZone\\\":\\\"UTC\\\",\\\"format\\\":\\\"ISO\\\"}) = 2026-07-03T06:00:00Z\" ],\n  \"conversation_history\": [ {\n  \"role\" : \"user\",\n  \"content\" : \"What evidence is missing for audit case a05gL00000JtZ74QAF?\"\n} ],\n  \"response\": \"The audit case is still missing 3 required documents:\\n\\n1. Appraisal\\n2. Recorded Mortgage\\n3. Final Title Policy\\n\\nA human auditor will need to review and decide whether these items are cleared. Let me know if you need help drafting a request for these documents!\"\n}\n",
